  "solution_ref": "$ac=2$, $\\mathrm P(X\\le b)=\\frac58$ → $\\frac12bc=\\frac58$. $\\mathrm P(X\\le\\sqrt5)=\\frac12\\cdot\\sqrt5\\cdot\\frac cb\\sqrt5=\\frac12$ → $b=5c$, $5c^2=\\frac54$, $c=\\frac12$, $b=\\frac52$, $a=4$. 합 $7$",
